==Russian==

===Etymology===
Connected with {{m|ru|уважа́ть||to [[respect]]}}, which is (per Vasmer) borrowed from {{cog|pl|uważać||to [[consider]]}}, in turn connected with {{cog|de|Waage||[[scales]]}}. {{surf|ru|у-||alt2=-важ-|-ить}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ува́жить}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|ува́жить|pf}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[consider]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[humor]] (someone)
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[respect]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[grant]], to [[comply]] with (a [[request]])

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4a+p|ува́жить}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ru|разува́жить}}
* {{l|ru|уваже́ние}}
* {{l|ru|уважи́тельный}}
* {{l|ru|уважа́ть}}
* {{l|ru|уважа́емый}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|отва́живаться|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|отва́житься|g=pf}}
